OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA clear
OL,6,Fnight for much of the region and with
OL,7,Flight winds temperatures will fall
OL,8,Faway quickly. Some patchy cloud
OL,9,Fperhaps developing late in the night,
OL,10,Fbut remaining dry.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FFine and bright after a
OL,13,Fchilly start. Plenty of hazy sunshine
OL,14,Fwith the greatest chance of any
OL,15,Fthicker cloud affecting Yorkshire.
OL,16,FRather warm by the afternoon, but a
OL,17,Fstrengthening breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
