OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudier
OL,6,Fwith a chance of rain Friday. Drier
OL,7,Fand brighter over the weekend with
OL,8,Fsome sunny or clear spells, although
OL,9,Fbreezy at times. Temperatures near or
OL,10,Fslightly above normal.
